'''BOOM Esports''' (formerly known as '''BOOM ID''') is a multi-gaming organization based in Indonesia. Founded and operated by Gary Ongko Putera in 2016. The team has also formed a roster in multiple games such as [[dota2:Main Page|DOTA2]], [[counterstrike:Main Page|CS:GO]], [[valorant:Main Page|Valorant]], and more.

